	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nescio vero, quo novo casu acciderit, mi colende charissimeque in domino frater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ut tot iam ferme seculo, quod mihi certe videtur, nihil ad te scripserim, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nihil etiam literarum ipse quoque a te datum acceperim, cum adeo antea in scribe<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ndi officio neuter cessaverit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Agnosco quidem hic vel hoc nomine silentii mei <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>culpam, quod gratitudinem meam erga te cęterosque pientissimos et doctissimos viros <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vel literis, quando aliter non licet, iam dudum testari debebam pro eximiis illis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>multumque sumptuosis christianę humanitatis officiis, quibus me cumul<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ate adeo ac longe supra meritum meum, cum nuper istic essem, prosequebamini.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Te igitur, cui magis etiam gratitudinem meam probare opportebat, per quae<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cunque flecti potes, obsecro et obtestor, impudentiam nimirum ingratitudini con<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>iungens, ut vicem hic meam amice officioseque impleas et mea caussa, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sed elegantissimis tuis verbis optimis illis et incomparabilibus viris gratias, quantas <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>potes, et maximas agas, tibi imprimis, quem cum pro syncera, quam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>invicem a multis iam annis sancte coluimus, amicitia alterum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>me non possum non agnoscere, nihil pudet interpellare ac quicquid abs <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>te flagitare eorum, quę ipse, si possem, omnibus modis, infelicius licet, praestare.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Ego, quod unum possum, omnium bonorum benignissimum largitorem supplicibus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>votis imploro, ut gratias omnibus singulisque vobis de inexhaustę bonitatis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>suę thesauro affatim referat pro tanta vestra in me munificentia, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>qui ne calici quidem aquę frigidę suo nomine porrecto, nedum tantis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>charitatis officiis et beneficiis mercedem defuturam pollicitur etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Praecipuum, quod scire magnopere ex tua charitate cupio, illud est, num <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tibi libellus ille authore d. d. <persName ref="p4183">Iacobo Andreę</persName>, <placeName ref="l195">Göppingensis</placeName> ecclesię ministro, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>conscriptus et divulgatus De Christi cęna probetur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ego boni viri <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>pium conatum multum exosculor, quod pacis et concordię studiosum adeo in<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>telligam, verum nondum satis, qualis successus futurus sit, video, cum nonnulla, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quę inprimis dilucida et simplicia esse opportebat, plus satis contorqueat <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et involvat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Deinde fac sciam, obsecro, quid de sanctissimorum <persName ref="p1049">Farelli</persName> et <persName ref="p8033">Bezę</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>confessione coram Wirtempergico de eodem argumento facta cum symmystis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>tuis sentiatis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l569">Wormaciensi</placeName> colloquio, postquam cęptum est, nihil accepi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> scribitur 1a septembris,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>das der neuw pundt zuͦ Lantsperg gemeret werde; seyen yetz<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ouch vyl bischoff drin kommen, alls Saltzburg, Wirtzburg, Bambegr, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Frysingen, sampt evangelischen stetten, Nuremberg, <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName>, Ulm, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>damitt sy dester baß by dem evangelio belyben mögind; <foreign xml:lang="la">scilicet evangelium <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>hostibus evangelii defendent!</foreign></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><placeName>Polwyler</placeName> hat 20 fenle um <placeName ref="l1464">Horb</placeName> umher zuͦ einer nachhuͦt, ob der <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Engellender iren bedorffte.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><placeName>Pfaltz</placeName> und <placeName ref="l572">Wirtemberg</placeName> haben denselbigen <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>knechten uff der juppen wellen machen; in dem ist bottschafft von dem konig <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>kommen, man solle sy abschaffen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName>Silvest(e)r Raid</persName> und grauff von <placeName>Ortenburg</placeName> sollen ein reissigen zug ussbringen; <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>habend noch nitt uber 500 pferd, rosß und küen angenomen; <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ligend <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName> und <placeName>Roggenburg</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Churfursten und all fursten <foreign xml:lang="la">ex nostris</foreign> sollend zuͦ Ulm versamlet werden <foreign xml:lang="la">ex<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>tra <placeName ref="l749">Saxonem</placeName>;</foreign> der hat d. d. Lyndeman <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>(und) Carlowitz mandiert, die regieren.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Der konig zalt die koffleut nitt um die jerlichen nutzig, die er erlegen sollt <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>von so grossem guͦt, das er von inen uffgenommen; schribt, er müsse yetz alles <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>zum krieg bruchen, das die koflut gar ubel zefriden.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Schribt unser W(elser) und <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>bevilcht mir, euch vyl vyl dienst und gruͦtz von im zuͦzeschriben; er meint, die <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>koofleut werdind sich nitt mehr insetzen lassen, gellt usszelichen dergstalt.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName>S. Quintin</persName> soll noch vest halten und nitt weniger schaden heruß thain, dann die find <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>hinein, wiewol sydher die tag zytung kommen, solle gewunnen sin; incertum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Itidem <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> scribitur pontificem 18000 scorta <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName> eiecisse singulis <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>prius duorum aureorum coronatorum irrogata multa.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">An vero non hoc est, mi <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, resipiscere ac novam ecclesię reformationem serio meditari?</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Putant autem omnes etiam cinaedos et omnino Sodomitas proscripturum fuisse, nisi <placeName ref="l425">Romam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>prorsus in solitudinem redactum iri (si faceret) metuisset, nullo scilicet ne in ponti<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ficia quidem aula reliquo facto.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>De gravissimo vulnere, quod <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> accepit idque in ipsis regni visceribus, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>non est ut quicquam ego ad te, qui melius omnia tenes.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Hoc tamen scribo periculum <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>esse, ne sint ista longe atrociorum malorum initia, cum praesertim <persName>Gallus</persName> adeo <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>cruentus et sanctorum sanguine aebrius esse strenue pergat mensuram <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>suam haud dubie brevi impleturus pariter et sensurus eadem mensura <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>cumulate sibi remetientem.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Neque enim porro dissimulaturus videtur iustus deus, <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>sed sanguinem sanctorum suorum tam largiter a multis iam annis perfusum valida <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>sua manu et porrecto brachio iamiam fortiter vindicabit, quem nos indefatiga<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>bili precandi studio interpellemus, ut suis interea spiritus sancti sui inexpugnabili <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>virtute clementer adsit animosque illis infractos et omnibus humnais rebus <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>superiores addat, quo devicto cum suis quoque armis mundi principe secum... <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>spiritu quidem in celis regnent ac triumphent, hic autem in terris ecclesię Christi <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>agrum ita sanguine suo invictęque tolerantię exemplo stercorent, ut maior <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>inde et uberior messis subinde felicissime assurgat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Bene vale, mi anime plusquam charissime tu optime frater, cum domestica tua ecclesia <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>omnibusque fratribus et amicis, qui in Christo me diligunt, quorum omnium <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>apud gratię thronum patrocinio iuvari cum meis unice cupio.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z31"/>Domino d. <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martyri</persName> fidelissimoque Christi testi reverenter me amantissimequ<lb xml:id="p2z32"/>e commenda, quem quod videre, quod colloqui nuper mihi contigit, inter <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>praecipuos felicitatis meę calculos merito numeravero.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Atque o ter quaterque <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>ac millies etiam felix <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>, quod dominus tot incomperabilium virorum doctrina vitęque <lb xml:id="p2z35"/>exemplis illustrat, qui propitius tibi faxit, ut ne ad cęlos usque exaltata <lb xml:id="p2z36"/>ad inferos usque, quod visitationis tuę tempus non agnoveris, detraharis.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z37"/>Salutem tibi adscribere iubent seque commndari volunt <persName ref="p4868">Funclius</persName> meus <lb xml:id="p2z38"/>cum <persName ref="p1057">Fuchsio</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p1057">Peter Fuchs</persName>.</note>, <persName>Witenbacho</persName> et seniore d. <persName>Iacobo</persName>, inprimis mea coniunx.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z39"/>Dominus Iesus Christus vos omnes quam diutissime incolumes ecclesię suę <lb xml:id="p2z40"/>ministerio fideliter feliciterque adeo ministrantes et commodantes conservet.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z41"/>Bienne 18. septembris anno 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z42"/>Vere tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambr[osius] Blaur[<lb xml:id="p2z43"/>erus</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
